summary:
  The answer of a reading that was ended is taken like any other.

history:
  A helper that was ended comes home with nothing. Taken as an answer, that
  stamps the station as one that gave no number, and it is not asked about
  again before the next day.

target:
  package/contents/ui/Loudness.qml

find:
          if (_seq < 0 || KindLogic.seqOf(mine) !== _seq) return true;

replace:
          if (KindLogic.seqOf(mine) < 0) return true;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_a_stop_ends_the_reading_and_removes_its_file.
  Line-neutral.
